## CURRENT STATE
- D1–D10 complete and merged into `main`. Baseline of the current work: `06127b4c58d0ed49e502c89ac8e16ad5ea949c65`.
- UI work package opened as a PR from `fix/ui-messaggi-account-legal-registrazione-cantina`, built from `origin/main`. 22 files touched (18 modified, 4 new).
- Messaggi: the linked-listing thumbnail in `ConversationHeader.tsx` no longer renders a raw `<img>`. `conversations_page` projects `coalesce(l.immagini[1], '')`, so a photo-less listing produced `src=""` and the browser broken-image icon; the shared `SafeImage` foundation now covers both the empty URL and the URL that fails to load. `SafeImage` gained a `compact` placeholder for boxes too small for the labelled fallback. No new read: the value is the one the conversation already carries.
- Account → Attività di vendita: the "Da gestire" KPI is replaced by "Valore indicativo", the sum of the asking prices of the seller's active listings, computed in `riepilogoVenditore` from the listings already fetched. The hint states explicitly that it is not a balance, not revenue and not a payout. Cents stay integral via per-row `Math.round`.
- Centro legale: `/legale` has a real back action. `AzioneIndietro` is a new client component (history when it exists, `routes.home` otherwise, decided at click time to avoid hydration mismatch); the page stays a Server Component. The fallback is an internal route, never derived from referrer or query.
- Registrazione: the redundant "Confermo di avere almeno 18 anni" checkbox is removed from both `/registrati` and `/completa-profilo`. On each surface it fed only the local `valid` boolean and was never persisted: the write carries `dob`, and the authoritative barrier is the CHECK on `public.profiles.dob`, which binds the UPDATE from `/completa-profilo` exactly as it binds the signup INSERT. Date of birth stays mandatory, `isMaggiorenne` still blocks submission, the Termini/Privacy checkbox stays a real consent, and the 18+ requirement stays written on both pages.
- Scheda annuncio: `PriceIntelligencePanel` moved below "Quando berlo" and "Abbinamenti gastronomici" instead of above them. Same panel, same `vista={vistaPrezzi}`, same D3 data and provider — only its position changed. `src/lib/annuncio/ordine-sezioni.test.ts` pins the order and the single occurrence of each section.
- Cantina: the value/contabilità block moved below the bottle list and above "Cosa bere adesso", and was redesigned — one prominent main value, a trend badge rendered only when `performanceCents` has a sign, three supporting voices in a `<dl>`, and the chart inside the same frame via the new `incorniciato={false}` variant of `ValoreNelTempo`. Same four D3-B voices, same series, no new formula, snapshot, history or provider.
- KPI source completeness: `leggiMieiAnnunci` in `listing-service.ts` now paginates with `.range()` in pages of 1000 (matching the project-wide PostgREST `max_rows` in `supabase/config.toml`) until a short page ends the loop, with a secondary `id` ordering key so a `created_at` tie cannot straddle a page boundary. All of the seller's listings reach both the sales list and the "Valore indicativo" KPI; sequential pages, no N+1, same error semantics (a mid-loop failure returns the generic error, never a partial list). Behavior beyond 1000 rows is proven by `src/services/listing-paginazione.test.ts`.
- Validation run: full `frontend-next` suite 1292/1292 across 80 files, `bun run typecheck` clean, `git diff --check` clean. `MIN_TESTS` raised 1256 → 1283 → 1292 in `.github/workflows/ci.yml` and in the `prelaunch-contract.test.ts` assertion that mirrors it, together in the same change. The floor was never lowered.
- No migration, no production read or write, no Supabase deployment. Phase 13 cutover has not started.

